EXT. PARK - DAY

MIA, an athletic girl in a tracksuit, stretches. Her coach RAY, an old man with a whistle, points at the track.

RAY
Ten laps. Go!

Mia runs. Ray claps and shouts.

RAY
Faster!

Mia stops, breathes hard and kneels on the grass. Ray walks over and gives her a bottle.

MIA
I can't anymore.

RAY
(smiling)
Yes, you can.

Mia stands up and runs again.
